Support nimani o'lchaydi?
A) To'plam savatlarning qancha qismida uchrashini
B) Qoidaning ishonchliligini
C) Mahsulot narxini
ANSWER: A

Confidence(A → B) qanday hisoblanadi?
A) support(A∪B) / support(A)
B) support(A) / support(B)
C) support(A) + support(B)
ANSWER: A

Lift = 1 nimani bildiradi?
A) A va B bir-biriga bog'liq emas
B) A va B doim birga
C) Qoida noto'g'ri
ANSWER: A
